WEBVTT

00:00:06.080 --> 00:00:09.170
I wanna invent a good special attack
that's fit for a Shadow Mistress like me!

00:00:09.170 --> 00:00:12.290
<b>HOW THINGS USUALLY GO FOR SHAMIKO</b>

00:00:09.170 --> 00:00:12.290
<b>SHE GETS INVOLVED IN SOMETHING</b>

00:00:09.170 --> 00:00:12.290
<b>AND THEN ENDS UP BEING CHASED</b>

00:00:09.330 --> 00:00:12.080
I've been getting chased around a lot lately.

00:00:12.380 --> 00:00:15.540
So I think having a super move to use
when I'm in trouble would be really awesome!

00:00:12.500 --> 00:00:24.830
<b>HOW THINGS USUALLY GO FOR SHAMIKO</b>

00:00:12.500 --> 00:00:24.830
<b>SHE GETS INVOLVED IN SOMETHING</b>

00:00:12.500 --> 00:00:24.830
<b>AND THEN ENDS UP BEING CHASED</b>

00:00:15.750 --> 00:00:17.580
Like, "Shadow Thingy!"

00:00:17.960 --> 00:00:19.420
Or some cool-sounding name like that.

00:00:19.710 --> 00:00:21.380
Forget about the name.

00:00:21.380 --> 00:00:24.830
Start by figuring out something reliable that you
can attack your opponents with in an emergency.

00:00:25.290 --> 00:00:27.830
Like beams, or punches, or a deathlock.

00:00:29.210 --> 00:00:31.330
We're talking about when I'm in the dreamscape, right?

00:00:31.330 --> 00:00:33.420
Just think about what you can do in reality for now.

00:00:33.750 --> 00:00:37.710
Plip plop. Plip plop. Plip plop. Plip plop.

00:00:34.960 --> 00:00:37.710
Then the only thing I can reliably attack with are tears.

00:00:37.710 --> 00:00:39.960
Okay, so I guess your super move will be
"Shadow Weepy Tears."

00:00:40.580 --> 00:00:44.290
The stress of dealing with an emergency situation
will prevent you from using your full strength.

00:00:44.420 --> 00:00:47.750
Not to mention that you need different strategies
to get out of different situations.

00:00:48.000 --> 00:00:48.920
So let's do some practice!

00:00:48.920 --> 00:00:49.380
Grip.

00:00:49.080 --> 00:00:49.630
<b>GRIP</b>

00:00:49.630 --> 00:00:51.710
Uh oh. I don't like the sound of that.

00:00:52.000 --> 00:00:54.380
Okay, situation 1: when someone grabs you
by the collar, do this!

00:00:52.380 --> 00:00:53.130
Huh?

00:00:54.380 --> 00:00:55.170
Blargh!

00:00:54.420 --> 00:00:55.040
<b>Blargh!</b>

00:00:55.250 --> 00:00:57.540
Situation 2: when you need to incapacitate
someone who's resisting, do this!
Whoa, mind if I snap some pics?<b></b>

00:00:55.580 --> 00:00:58.500
<b>Click</b>

00:00:55.580 --> 00:00:58.500
<b>Click</b>

00:00:55.590 --> 00:00:58.500
<b>Click</b>

00:00:57.540 --> 00:00:58.330
Bwlarghef!

00:00:57.920 --> 00:00:58.500
<b>Bwlarghef!</b>

00:00:58.630 --> 00:01:00.960
I can't stop my Shadow Weepy Tears from coming out.

00:00:58.750 --> 00:00:59.130
<b>Click</b>

